1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Twenty-Seventh Episode
Magic Water

15
00:02:50,341 --> 00:02:52,809
I was deceived
by the fake Choppy...

16
00:02:52,941 --> 00:02:55,409
...and I was thrown down
into the valley.

17
00:02:55,661 --> 00:02:57,891
There, a mysterious gas
blinded me...

18
00:02:58,901 --> 00:03:01,973
...and I finally returned
to the castle with difficulty,

19
00:03:02,421 --> 00:03:04,935
only to find
a fake Sapphire there.

20
00:03:05,581 --> 00:03:08,698
But I will not give up!
Whatever happens,

21
00:03:08,741 --> 00:03:11,699
I will thwart this conspiracy
and Dad and Mom...

22
00:03:19,141 --> 00:03:21,052
Who's there?

23
00:03:24,101 --> 00:03:26,251
This sounds to me like
the laughter of Satan!

24
00:03:26,301 --> 00:03:29,418
Yes! And today I will succeed
in stealing your heart!

25
00:03:32,421 --> 00:03:36,494
It's useless! Don't you want to know
where your father and mother are?

26
00:03:36,541 --> 00:03:38,736
What? You know where they are?

27
00:03:38,981 --> 00:03:42,530
Now I understand...
You kidnapped my father and my mother!

28
00:03:42,621 --> 00:03:44,737
Please, tell me where they are!

29
00:03:45,701 --> 00:03:49,330
I will tell you, if in exchange
you give me your heart!

30
00:04:00,021 --> 00:04:03,570
Stone crane,
fly to my house!

31
00:04:30,061 --> 00:04:33,178
- Where am I?
- This is my house!

32
00:04:33,221 --> 00:04:35,735
Tell me...
Where are my father and my mother?

33
00:04:36,181 --> 00:04:40,174
Fine, as promised I'll tell you:
they are on Snake Island.

34
00:04:41,301 --> 00:04:44,976
- Snake Island?
- Yes! They are there, motionless...

35
00:04:45,021 --> 00:04:47,489
...and they don't say a word!
- What do you mean?

36
00:04:49,221 --> 00:04:53,499
With a spell of mine, I turned
them into stone statues...

37
00:04:53,541 --> 00:04:56,101
and now they can't even move a hair.

38
00:04:57,301 --> 00:04:59,610
Mom and Dad are stone statues?!

39
00:04:59,741 --> 00:05:02,892
Untie this rope, I want
to go to Snake Island!

40
00:05:03,021 --> 00:05:06,252
- Untie this rope!
- All right!

41
00:05:06,621 --> 00:05:10,170
I'll untie you, but only after
you've given your heart to Zelda.

42
00:05:10,381 --> 00:05:13,612
Zelda! Zelda, come here!
Zelda!

43
00:05:14,741 --> 00:05:17,972
Zelda, answer me!
Zelda, wait for me!

44
00:05:18,781 --> 00:05:23,297
Zelda, come out! Maybe
you don't like his heart?

45
00:05:26,901 --> 00:05:29,210
Father... Mother...
I'm sorry!

46
00:05:29,661 --> 00:05:32,494
I wish I could do it,
but I can't help you!

47
00:05:33,261 --> 00:05:35,411
If only I could see..

48
00:05:35,901 --> 00:05:39,655
But it's too late!
Soon Satan will return!

49
00:05:42,621 --> 00:05:46,136
- Zelda, where are you?
- I'm here!

50
00:05:51,301 --> 00:05:55,010
Zelda, come on, answer me!
Where are you, Zelda?

51
00:05:55,301 --> 00:05:59,214
May I know where you've hidden yourself?
Answer me!

52
00:06:00,981 --> 00:06:04,690
I've got it! She must have hidden
in one of these jars!

53
00:06:10,261 --> 00:06:12,411
I saw you!
So you're in here!

54
00:06:12,461 --> 00:06:15,498
I've caught you, Zelda!
Come out, Zelda!

55
00:06:15,540 --> 00:06:18,100
Please, obey your father.

56
00:06:20,020 --> 00:06:21,932
I'm sorry Dad..

57
00:06:22,020 --> 00:06:24,057
Zelda, open the lid!

58
00:06:24,100 --> 00:06:26,820
I won't scold you,
but please, come out!

59
00:06:28,180 --> 00:06:30,649
I know you're hidden
in this jar!

60
00:06:32,660 --> 00:06:35,812
Thank you, Zelda,
I am grateful to you for saving me

61
00:06:36,180 --> 00:06:39,298
Hurry and get ready to run away!
Run, now!

62
00:06:39,420 --> 00:06:42,731
If Dad finds out that the lid
doesn't open, he'll come back!

63
00:06:42,780 --> 00:06:45,340
Please, Zelda!
Please, come out!

64
00:06:45,380 --> 00:06:49,499
I can't break the jar with a
magic spell if you are inside!

65
00:07:08,540 --> 00:07:11,499
Come on, Sapphire, hold
on until we get to a ship!

66
00:07:19,940 --> 00:07:22,296
I would like to treat
your eyes, but I can't.

67
00:07:22,420 --> 00:07:25,731
I'm already grateful to you
for bringing me this far, Zelda.

68
00:07:33,500 --> 00:07:35,412
There's the ship!

69
00:07:44,020 --> 00:07:46,012
Come on, be brave!

70
00:07:49,140 --> 00:07:52,338
We have to reach Snake
Island before Dad arrives!

71
00:07:57,820 --> 00:08:00,460
I'm afraid that Dad
is really angry!

72
00:08:09,300 --> 00:08:11,815
I wonder how long
I've been asleep.

73
00:08:15,820 --> 00:08:17,812
I thought the direction
had changed...

74
00:08:17,860 --> 00:08:19,738
...while I was sleeping,
but it's the same!

75
00:08:19,780 --> 00:08:22,090
- Are we at Snake Island already?
- Not yet!

76
00:08:22,220 --> 00:08:25,338
I want to see my father and my mother
as soon as possible.

77
00:08:25,380 --> 00:08:27,372
You will see them soon, Sapphire!

78
00:08:36,220 --> 00:08:40,009
- That is the Island of Snakes!
- Really?! Finally, we are here!

79
00:08:40,140 --> 00:08:42,609
Hold on tight to the boat,
there are many whirlpools.

80
00:08:42,660 --> 00:08:45,220
We must be careful,
because they are very dangerous.

81
00:09:22,901 --> 00:09:25,256
Zelda! Where are you, Zelda?

82
00:09:26,621 --> 00:09:30,409
- I am safe, Sapphire!
Is everything okay? - Yes!

83
00:09:30,461 --> 00:09:33,612
Even though it was tough, finally
we are on the Island of Snakes!

84
00:09:33,661 --> 00:09:35,731
What?! This is it?
And where are they?

85
00:09:35,781 --> 00:09:38,011
They must be somewhere
on this island!

86
00:09:45,141 --> 00:09:47,132
Sapphire, quick, hide!

87
00:09:47,821 --> 00:09:49,812
- What is happening?
- Be quiet! There are many...

88
00:09:49,861 --> 00:09:52,739
...sea snakes on this island!
If they discover us, we will die!

89
00:10:12,821 --> 00:10:14,812
Sapphire! It's on your head!

90
00:10:17,261 --> 00:10:19,252
Let's get out of here!

91
00:10:24,221 --> 00:10:25,813
Up!

92
00:10:26,421 --> 00:10:28,412
We have almost arrived.

93
00:10:34,861 --> 00:10:37,580
Sapphire, look!
There are your father and your mother!

94
00:10:38,861 --> 00:10:40,852
Where are they, Zelda?

95
00:10:41,661 --> 00:10:43,652
This is your mother, Sapphire.

96
00:10:46,341 --> 00:10:49,538
This is her?!
This cold stone is my mother?

97
00:10:49,901 --> 00:10:52,335
Oh, mother!
My mother!

98
00:10:53,581 --> 00:10:57,096
Please, tell me: how
do I break the spell?

99
00:10:57,461 --> 00:10:59,895
One way is to have
my father do it.

100
00:11:00,781 --> 00:11:03,659
I really don't think he
would be willing to do it!

101
00:11:04,021 --> 00:11:06,091
And another way is
to pour over them...

102
00:11:06,141 --> 00:11:08,780
...the greatest possible amount of
the blood of the one who loves them.

103
00:11:08,821 --> 00:11:11,130
The greatest possible
amount of blood?

104
00:11:12,101 --> 00:11:15,457
I love them more than
anyone else! Then, if I pour...

105
00:11:15,501 --> 00:11:18,459
...all my blood over them,
the spell will be broken!

106
00:11:18,501 --> 00:11:20,969
- That's right, isn't it?
- But it's impossible!

107
00:11:22,621 --> 00:11:24,976
It is possible! I can do it!

108
00:11:25,221 --> 00:11:29,578
Father! Mother! I will break the
spell that Satan has cast on you!

109
00:11:29,621 --> 00:11:32,215
No, Sapphire! If you do
such a thing, you will die!

110
00:11:33,021 --> 00:11:35,012
- Let me go!
- Sapphire...!

111
00:11:35,101 --> 00:11:39,253
- Zelda! Zelda!
- Here is my father!

112
00:11:42,541 --> 00:11:45,692
- Satan...
- Sapphire, it's dangerous!

113
00:11:47,701 --> 00:11:49,612
Sapphire!

114
00:11:54,621 --> 00:11:57,340
- Sapphire!
- Father! Mother..

115
00:12:16,661 --> 00:12:21,098
Throw that body overboard
and let the fish eat it!

116
00:12:22,101 --> 00:12:24,092
But he is still alive!

117
00:12:26,221 --> 00:12:28,530
He must have escaped
from some island.

118
00:12:28,581 --> 00:12:33,052
To avoid unpleasant situations, it will
be better to throw him back into the sea.

119
00:12:33,101 --> 00:12:36,571
It's a shame to throw him back
into the sea after we've saved him!

120
00:12:40,661 --> 00:12:44,540
- Wait! Don't throw him overboard!
- At your orders, Captain!

121
00:12:45,141 --> 00:12:48,497
Silver, don't you dare do
anything without my permission!

122
00:12:49,101 --> 00:12:52,298
I want to take a look at
him. Bring him to my room!

123
00:13:18,741 --> 00:13:21,494
I've hoped so much to be able to
see you again one day, Sapphire.

124
00:13:21,541 --> 00:13:23,611
And that day has come!
But now sleep well...

125
00:13:23,661 --> 00:13:25,891
...and try to recover your
health soon!

126
00:13:30,341 --> 00:13:33,094
- Where am I?
- You've woken up!

127
00:13:33,141 --> 00:13:35,132
Who's there? Who are you?

128
00:13:35,421 --> 00:13:38,299
- It's me, Captain Blood!
- Captain Blood?!

129
00:13:38,341 --> 00:13:40,980
Don't you remember me?
You saved me that time...

130
00:13:41,021 --> 00:13:43,455
...when I was arrested
by the Grand Duke, a year ago!

131
00:13:43,501 --> 00:13:45,731
And now, as you see,
I'm a pirate!

132
00:13:47,021 --> 00:13:50,491
But what happened to your eyes?
Can't you see me?

133
00:13:51,261 --> 00:13:54,651
What the hell happened to you?
Tell me, if you want.

134
00:13:56,901 --> 00:13:59,859
It must have been a plot
by the Ice Queen.

135
00:13:59,901 --> 00:14:01,812
- Ice Queen?!
- Exactly!

136
00:14:01,901 --> 00:14:04,973
They say that soon
the Ice Queen's army

137
00:14:05,141 --> 00:14:08,099
...will prepare
to occupy Silverland, understand?

138
00:14:08,141 --> 00:14:10,177
Then Satan and the fake Sapphire...

139
00:14:10,221 --> 00:14:12,974
Yes, they must be accomplices
of the Ice Queen.

140
00:14:13,021 --> 00:14:15,216
It's just
the way she operates.

141
00:14:15,701 --> 00:14:19,250
Damned Ice Queen!
As soon as I see her again, I'll kill her!

142
00:14:19,301 --> 00:14:22,498
If you want to do that, for a start,
we have to heal your eyes!

143
00:14:22,541 --> 00:14:25,135
Heal my eyes?
But can they be healed?

144
00:14:25,221 --> 00:14:28,213
Pirates travel the world
and hear many things.

145
00:14:28,301 --> 00:14:31,418
I have heard talk
of the Magic Spring!

146
00:14:31,461 --> 00:14:33,452
- Magic Spring?!
- Yes!

147
00:14:33,501 --> 00:14:36,015
If you wash your eyes
with its magic water,

148
00:14:36,101 --> 00:14:39,650
the water will remove the poison
and soon you will be able to see again.

149
00:14:40,021 --> 00:14:44,219
Really? Are you serious?
Do you think I will be able to see again?

150
00:14:44,261 --> 00:14:47,776
We might encounter dangers
on the way to the Black Island,

151
00:14:47,821 --> 00:14:50,938
where the Spring is located,
but do not fear, I will protect you!

152
00:14:51,341 --> 00:14:54,219
How stupid Blood is!
I can't stand being entangled

153
00:14:54,261 --> 00:14:57,253
...in a dangerous undertaking
because of that brat! Let's go!

154
00:14:57,701 --> 00:15:00,499
It's cold on the deck,
let's go back to the cabin.

155
00:15:01,981 --> 00:15:04,814
Damn Blood!
You will pay for this!

156
00:15:05,341 --> 00:15:07,696
Why do you say that we
will encounter dangers?

157
00:15:07,781 --> 00:15:11,137
Because to get there we
have to pass Wild Rock...

158
00:15:11,181 --> 00:15:14,810
...and Koto Inlet.
- Are they very dangerous?

159
00:15:15,101 --> 00:15:18,889
Don't worry! In the meantime
drink this, it'll warm you up.

160
00:15:19,221 --> 00:15:21,291
No, I can't drink alcohol.

161
00:15:21,821 --> 00:15:25,336
Then I'll give you something
that is much better than alcohol.

162
00:15:25,381 --> 00:15:27,372
I think I put it here.

163
00:15:27,621 --> 00:15:31,409
It's true that I helped you,
but why are you so kind to me?

164
00:15:31,821 --> 00:15:34,813
Well, I can't answer you
just like that!

165
00:15:35,181 --> 00:15:37,297
Here it is, I found it!

166
00:15:37,341 --> 00:15:40,731
You'll see that this
will do you much more good than alcohol!

167
00:15:42,181 --> 00:15:44,695
- But what is it?
- It's a dress.

168
00:15:44,741 --> 00:15:48,097
I kept it because I was convinced
that I would meet you one day.

169
00:15:48,141 --> 00:15:50,291
- Try it on! - Don't make
fun of me! I'm a boy!

170
00:15:50,341 --> 00:15:54,050
Sapphire, even if you pretend to be
a boy, I know you're a girl.

171
00:15:54,221 --> 00:15:56,212
Don't insist!

172
00:15:57,141 --> 00:15:59,974
All right! All right, Sapphire!
For now I won't insist,

173
00:16:00,021 --> 00:16:03,730
but please try it on if you have
some free time one day.

174
00:16:14,541 --> 00:16:17,294
What's happening?
There's a rock in front of us!

175
00:16:17,701 --> 00:16:20,010
- There's another one!
- Another one!

176
00:16:24,941 --> 00:16:26,977
- Help!
- Help!

177
00:16:36,581 --> 00:16:39,539
Water will get in,
hurry up and repair it!

178
00:16:41,261 --> 00:16:43,570
- The water has stopped!
- It's stopped!

179
00:16:44,621 --> 00:16:46,691
Help, Blood!

180
00:16:48,141 --> 00:16:51,417
The Wild Rock!
The Wild Rock...

181
00:16:52,661 --> 00:16:54,538
Watch out!

182
00:16:57,981 --> 00:17:02,133
- Is everything okay, Sapphire?
- Yes! But what the hell happened?

183
00:17:04,021 --> 00:17:06,057
- The Wild Rock!
- The Wild Rock?!

184
00:17:06,101 --> 00:17:09,093
But we're going to the Black Island,
where the magic Spring is!

185
00:17:09,141 --> 00:17:12,258
Yes! I'll help you, Sapphire,
even if you don't want me to!

186
00:17:13,701 --> 00:17:17,296
Hey, don't waste time!
Don't let the water in!

187
00:17:23,341 --> 00:17:25,252
Sapphire, be careful!

188
00:17:28,661 --> 00:17:30,652
Correct the course!

189
00:17:31,341 --> 00:17:33,252
Damn it!

190
00:17:49,981 --> 00:17:54,497
- Hurrah!
- Hurrah!

191
00:17:55,261 --> 00:17:57,252
Silver, what have you done?

192
00:17:57,421 --> 00:17:59,810
Listen, Captain, it seems
to me that you can't...

193
00:17:59,861 --> 00:18:02,421
...see anything else
besides Sapphire!

194
00:18:02,461 --> 00:18:06,249
- What?!
- Be more careful from now on!

195
00:18:27,221 --> 00:18:29,291
The island! The island!

196
00:18:29,341 --> 00:18:31,491
Sapphire, get up, the island is in sight!

197
00:18:44,701 --> 00:18:46,931
I feel dazed!

198
00:18:50,701 --> 00:18:52,692
There's a mermaid!

199
00:18:55,221 --> 00:18:57,212
- I'm going!
- Me too!

200
00:18:59,501 --> 00:19:01,696
Stay in your places!
Don't be fooled!

201
00:19:01,741 --> 00:19:03,811
That song is a spell!

202
00:19:09,221 --> 00:19:12,293
Oh, no, I feel dizzy too!

203
00:19:33,501 --> 00:19:35,492
Sapphire...

204
00:19:40,341 --> 00:19:43,492
Sapphire, thank you!
I've finally recovered.

205
00:19:45,021 --> 00:19:47,489
If you want the sharks to eat you, go!

206
00:19:47,541 --> 00:19:49,771
I will only stop at the Black Island!

207
00:19:49,821 --> 00:19:53,131
Damn it! I can't stand working for a girl!

208
00:19:53,181 --> 00:19:55,092
You'll pay for this too!

209
00:20:19,341 --> 00:20:23,300
Sapphire, this is the Black Island, where the magic Spring is.

210
00:20:26,021 --> 00:20:28,660
Silver, what do you need that saber for?

211
00:20:28,941 --> 00:20:32,217
You never know who you might run into.

212
00:20:35,021 --> 00:20:37,899
Blood, I hear the sound of water. Over there!

213
00:20:41,941 --> 00:20:44,216
There it is!
It must be the magic spring.

214
00:20:44,261 --> 00:20:46,536
Be careful, because the bottom is treacherous.

215
00:20:55,221 --> 00:20:57,132
Wash them with care.

216
00:21:05,941 --> 00:21:08,819
I can't see anything!
It's darker than ever!

217
00:21:09,621 --> 00:21:14,570
Wash them! Wash them! Fill your eyes with water and wash them thoroughly!

218
00:21:21,261 --> 00:21:23,821
- Well, Sapphire?
- Blood, watch out!

219
00:21:26,141 --> 00:21:28,735
What are you doing, Silver?
Have you decided to betray me?

220
00:21:28,901 --> 00:21:31,176
I've waited so long
for this moment!

221
00:21:31,221 --> 00:21:34,975
Before someone stops
me, Blood... On guard!

222
00:21:35,821 --> 00:21:38,016
Now I can see!
I can see!

223
00:21:42,821 --> 00:21:45,733
Fine, you damned traitor!
Come on, show some guts!

224
00:21:50,821 --> 00:21:53,016
Stop! Don't fight among yourselves!

225
00:21:55,021 --> 00:21:56,898
Oh! Damn it!

226
00:21:57,821 --> 00:21:59,732
Take this!

227
00:22:08,101 --> 00:22:11,138
Wait! I'm fighting too, now!

228
00:22:11,221 --> 00:22:16,818
You brat! You'll be the
first to die! Prepare yourself!

229
00:22:40,461 --> 00:22:42,895
Now you're alone.
What do you want to do?

230
00:22:43,221 --> 00:22:45,371
No, no, no! I surrender.

231
00:22:45,421 --> 00:22:48,219
I don't want to fight anymore! Goodbye!

232
00:22:55,541 --> 00:22:58,738
Are you okay, Blood? Wait,
I want to wash your wound

233
00:22:59,021 --> 00:23:02,980
I'm perfectly fine, it's just a
scratch. You're always so strong.

234
00:23:06,221 --> 00:23:10,419
But I still prefer the Sapphire
dressed like yesterday to this one.

235
00:23:11,261 --> 00:23:15,095
- Did you say something?
- No, no, I didn't say anything!

236
00:23:15,141 --> 00:23:17,496
But you should rest now.

237
00:23:17,821 --> 00:23:21,336
It's a truly wonderful thing
that you can see again, isn't it?

238
00:23:22,421 --> 00:23:25,458
Yes, Blood! And I owe
all of this only to you!

239
00:23:30,901 --> 00:23:34,450
So, Sapphire, please,
be careful. All right?

240
00:23:34,621 --> 00:23:36,691
Yes! Goodbye, Blood!

241
00:23:40,901 --> 00:23:42,892
Sapphire, take care of yourself!

242
00:23:43,181 --> 00:23:46,332
Goodbye, Blood!
Goodbye to everyone!

243
00:23:46,621 --> 00:23:52,776
- Goodbye! Goodbye, Sapphire!
- Bye, Sapphire!

244
00:23:56,341 --> 00:23:58,616
You'll see, now! I will
succeed in defeating...

245
00:23:58,661 --> 00:24:01,459
...Queen Icicle and
protecting Silverland!

246
00:24:02,941 --> 00:24:05,819
Father... Mother...
Please, wait for me!

